    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόσκῐ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
