				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἐν ψυκτηρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					146
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νιφάδι . . ὑ. θήσει
