					<u>Alex.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			.—In <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i>, leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόσκιος </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οις</span> codd.) . . <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφναις . . κατάκλισις.</span></div>
